Place 8 into stones.
Place 12 into stones.
Place 17 into stones.
Keep a shared seen as an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to 63.
Place 0 into seen.

Keep a shared found as 0.
Keep a shared good as 0.
To locate from target (a whole number) with spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than 7, return.
If item spot of stones is target, set found to spot, return.
Locate from target with spot plus 1.

To walk from spot (a whole number) with jump (a whole number).
If good is 1, return.
If spot is 7, set good to 1, return.
The mark is spot times 8 plus jump.
If item mark of seen is 1, return.
Set item mark of seen to 1.
Expand from spot with jump.

To expand from spot (a whole number) with jump (a whole number).
If good is 1, return.
The low is jump minus 1.
If low is more than 0, set found to -1.
If low is more than 0, locate from item spot of stones plus low with 0.
If low is more than 0 and found is at least 0, walk from found with low.
The same is jump.
Set found to -1.
Locate from item spot of stones plus same with 0.
If found is at least 0, walk from found with same.
The high is jump plus 1.
Set found to -1.
Locate from item spot of stones plus high with 0.
If found is at least 0, walk from found with high.

Walk from 0 with 1.
If good is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
